+// and nexus_web/src/__tests__/assistant-ui-stale-index-read.render.test.ts.
+//
+// assistant-ui subscribes messages and message parts BY INDEX through this
+// lookup. The host app's conversation list legitimately SHRINKS (a superseded
+// provider-error card is dropped, a transport retry discards a failed
